id: dead
name: Dead
kind: state
levels: 1
# A Special State (the user's terminology): no Narrative Requirement - "those dead Characters that are still relevant to your
# story should be in the Dead Special State at all times" (Damage & Recovery). Entered by dying on a Defeated card (Death).
specialState: true
description: >
  Stress Bonus 2 and Steadfast 1 higher; your own Life Point losses halved; Combat Rolls and Soak Value 1(bT) lower. Die again:
  erased from existence.
text: >
  Dead
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Stress Bonus by 2 and the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  (2)-[Passive]: Halve any Life Points you lose through your own effects (this still counts as having lost the full amount for your effects).
  (3)-[Passive]: Halve the amount of Ki Points you lose through the Draining Aspect.
  (4)-[Passive]: Reduce your Combat Rolls and Soak Value by 1(bT).
  (5)-[Automatic]: If you die, you are instead erased from existence.

---

[passive from 1]
# (1)
stressBonus += 2;
steadfast.dice += 1;
# (2) What your own effects take of your Life Points, halved - a Life Wager, Life Points spent (conditions.mjs ownLifeLoss).
allow life.ownLossHalved;
# (4)
combatRolls -= 1(bT);
soakValue -= 1(bT);
# (3) The Draining Aspect is not in this system yet (Transformations). (5) Dying again on a Defeated card: erased, said there
# (chat.mjs deathButtons).
